{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_50_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_50","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_50_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_50","textTraditional":"二十有一年春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_50_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_50","textTraditional":"夏五月辛酉，鄭伯突卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_50_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_50","textTraditional":"秋七月戊戌，夫人姜氏薨。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_50_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_50","textTraditional":"冬十有二月，葬鄭厲公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_50_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_50","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_50_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_50","textTraditional":"二十一年春，胥命於弭。夏，同伐王城。鄭伯將王自圉門入，虢叔自北門入，殺王子頹及五大夫。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_50_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_50","textTraditional":"鄭伯享王于闕西辟，樂備。王與之武公之略，自虎牢以東。原伯曰：「鄭伯傚尤，其亦將有咎。」五月，鄭厲公卒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_50_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_50","textTraditional":"王巡虢守。虢公為王宮于玤，王與之酒泉。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_50_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_50","textTraditional":"鄭伯之享王也，王以后之鞶鑑予之。虢公請器，王予之爵。鄭伯由是始惡於王。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_50_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_50","textTraditional":"冬，王歸自虢。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}